{"id":"cherez","lemma":"через","pos":"prep","rank":119,"glosses":["through","across, over","in, after"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1a/Ru-%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B7.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B7.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Через два-три дня будет лучше.","en":"It'll be better in two or three days.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1278797","words":[null,{"g":"two"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"day, daytime","l":"день"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Где вы будете через три часа?","en":"Where will you be three hours from now?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"three"},{"g":"hour","l":"час"}]},{"text":"Через сколько ты будешь готова?","en":"How soon will you be ready?","words":[null,{"g":"how much, how many"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Я могу это сделать через неделю.","en":"I can do it in a week.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"},null,null]},{"text":"Увидимся через двадцать минут.","en":"I'll see you in twenty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728304","words":[{"g":"see you later"},null,{"g":"twenty"},null]}]}